 turn this on to have more control over their jutsu windows.\n\n", "created_date": 1791511368, "id": "38793484456966679", "version": "5.0.5", "version_code": 267, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "38793484456966679"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1791504475, "id": "38791466380501820", "version": "5.0.5", "version_code": 266, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "38793484456966679"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "794049176269983"}]}, "change_log": "**5.0.5: Hotfix 5 (10/8/26)**\n*Dev Note: I'll be patching the update all week. I'm paying very close attention to your feedback on discord.*\n- Fixed more glitches where you can clip into geometry\n- Fixed damage effects showing on your screen when you didn\u2019t get actually get hit\n- Improved hand sign direction checks, which should help with more consistent rat hand signs especially\n- New gameplay setting: \"Cancel Jutsu Sequence by Repeating Last Sign\". Experienced players can turn this on to have more control over their jutsu windows.\n- New visual setting: \"Align Hand Sign Visuals\". Beginners can turn this off so they can see what angle their controllers are really at when they try to do hand signs", "created_date": 1791501073, "id": "38790546223927169", "version": "5.0.5", "version_code": 265, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "38793484456966679"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "794049176269983"}]}, "change_log": "**5.0.3: Hotfix 4 (10/7/26)**\n*Dev Note: I'll be patching the update all week. I'm paying very close attention to your feedback on discord.*\n- A kunai stabbed into you no longer prevents you from spawning your own kunai or force grabbing other kunai\n- Improved precision of hand signs\n- Fixed wall running glitch where you could phase into a building\n- Improved accuracy of paper bomb hit detection\n- Added an icon on your bottom bar in 2v2 so you always know which team color you\u2019re on", "created_date": 1791406133, "id": "38761246573523801", "version": "5.0.4", "version_code": 264, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26557592687222645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "38793484456966679"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "794049176269983"}]}, "change_log": "**5.0.3: Hotfix 3 (10/6/26)**\n*Dev Note: I'll be patching the update all week. I'm paying very close attention to your feedback on discord.*\n- Old players now get a popup to switch to legacy controls\n- Fixed hand sign detection. It's more precise like the old version but still slightly easier to activate signs.\n- Added boosted jump sensitivity slider in gameplay settings\n- Improved responsiveness of UI", "created_date": 1791309938, "id": "38733610076287451", "version": "5.0.3", "version_code": 263, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}